---
description: Logging rule
globs:
  - "**/*"
alwaysApply: true
---

- Log all important events with an an appropriate log level.
- Use two log files: First log file (lifelog_log.log) to log all events. Do not delete this file or its contents. Second, use a file called runtime_log.log to log the events of the current run of the program. Before every run, delete the content of runtime_log.log